	(text "Laser setpoint rev D: R67 909R is the scaler BOTTOM (to GND), not the servo tap.\nDAC 0-5V -> 22.62 mV at R81 0.25R -> 90.5 mA full scale (20 mW = 85.5 mA = 94.5% FS).\nPDH servo injects through R96 7.5M = 0.483 mA/V; an OPA192 railed to +14.8 V adds only\n+5.9 mA, so DAC full scale + a railed integrator = 96.4 mA, 3.6% under the\nDFB1550LP 100 mA absolute max. R134 15M to -5V cancels U24's 2.500 V VREF_MID\npedestal (exact 2:1 with R96; residual under 0.1 uA even at 5% tolerance).\nNet DITH_SUM is gone - R66/R67/R96/R134 all meet at N_U22_INP."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 480.568 306.578 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "3fa6af6b-017a-4d9c-820b-5a5926d37b00")
	)
