	(text "TEC bridge rev D: leg 1 (Q13/Q14) driven by U106 inverter + U107 buffer;\nleg 2 (Q17/Q18) stays on U21, so the two legs swing in antiphase.\nQ14/Q18 mirrored: P-ch SOURCE on the bridge node, DRAIN on -6V_TEC.\nU19 closes on TEC_IMON (R133/C171 integrator, fc 159 Hz), not TEC_BTF_N.\nU32 inputs swapped so cooling reads ABOVE 1.20 V, per firmware config.h."
