	(text "CARD ADDRESS via the SINGLE on-card jumper JP101 (10k pullup R127 to 3V3_DIG):\n  FITTED = GA0 0 = ch1 card;   OPEN = GA0 1 = ch2 card.\nOne strap sets the I2C address AND the ERR/MOD bus pair, so there is nothing\nelse to configure and no way to half-configure a card.\nv7: JP102/JP103 and pullups R128/R129 DELETED. GA1 was PCA9538 A1, and firmware\nfixes the expander at 0x70|GA0, so GA1 had exactly one legal setting; GA2 went\nonly to PCA9538 IO2 and nothing ever read it. Both pins are now tied to GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 606.552 307.594 0)
		(effects
