	)
	(text "FAULT_n = PCA9538 ~INT (open-drain, pullup on DIG card). LOCK_EN pulled down (R120) - safe at boot;"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 606.552 327.914 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d9126637-20c8-4100-bbc2-98ee82aab4f9")
	)
	(text "TEC H-BRIDGE HEATSINKS: HS1-HS4 = Wakefield 657-10ABPE on Q13/Q14/Q17/Q18 (combined footprint\nHeatsinks:TO-220-3_Vertical_HS657-10ABPE carries the copper - HS symbols are BOM-only).\nIsolate every tab: Boyd 4880G kit + #4-40 screw/washers/nut. Worst case ~10W/FET at 2.5A TEC cooling.\nFins vertical; keep away from NTC divider + precision scalers."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 332.994 380.492 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ebd4ebf0-f357-4f9a-a56b-034a725ac8b4")
	)
	(text "TEST POINTS TP501-TP530 (this card previously had none).\nSignal pads TestPoint_Pad_D1.0mm; the four GND are THT so a scope ground spring clips on.\nDELIBERATELY EXCLUDED, do not 'add for completeness': the U24 PI summing node\n(N_U24_INP, C76 1n - a pad's stray C shifts the integrator) and the two MPD TIA\ninverting inputs (N_U_TIA1_IN_ / N_U_TIA2_IN_, where stray C detunes C_f1/C_f2).\nSDA/SCL/ERRn_BUS/MODn_BUS/FAULT_n are reachable at the DIN blade or on the DIG card.\nFIDUCIALS: KiCad has no fiducial SYMBOL - place 3x Fiducial:Fiducial_1mm_Mask2mm as\nboard-only footprints if these are machine-assembled (mark them exclude-from-BOM)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 483.108 325.628 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f9ee665f-3456-486f-8817-4f5e3eb8d63c")
	)
	(text "Gate resistors are 470R, NOT 47R. On loop saturation each buffer drives its TWO\ngates toward +/-15 V into the D16/D17/D20/D21 forward clamps at +/-6.7 V:\n  47R  -> (15-6.7)/(47/2)  = 353 mA from a 200 mA OPA551 (current limit, then\n          thermal shutdown) and 0.7 V x 353 mA = 247 mW in a 500 mW MMSZ4702.\n  470R -> 35 mA and 25 mW. Gate pole 70 ns -> 0.7 us, still ~2000x above the\n          ~115 Hz TEC loop crossover, so the bridge dynamics are unaffected.\nR69/R70/R75 stay 47R - those are NTC/monitor line protection, not gate drive."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 490.22 362.204 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "fcd17d47-c94e-4528-b716-42cc748c60a2")
	)
